    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, that makes sense. I noticed something in the geological report though—it mentioned something about 'soil liquefaction potential' in the seismic stability section. It sounded pretty serious. Is that part of what you're calling the 'sediment risks,' or is that a separate issue we need to worry about?",
